for each application, there are tones of files like pod definition file, deployment definition file, service file, etc. when we need to update them, it's gonna be done one by one. 
helm is tool that helps us to do it easily. helm perform the application as a whole, helm knows which file to update, etc.

helm install <app-name>

helm upgrade <app-name>

helm rollback <app-name>

helm uninstall <app-name>


Helm 是工具，Chart 是被 Helm 安装的“应用包”
Chart 是“应用安装包”，Bitnami 是“提供这些安装包的仓库/厂商”
Bitnami: 一个专门提供高质量 Chart 和镜像的厂商/仓库，它提供很多现成 Chart，例如：
nginx
mysql
redis

$ helm install <release-name> <chart-name>        say,
helm install my-site-1 bitnami/wordpress  
helm install my-site-2 bitnami/wordpress
each of them can be released in different enviornments like DEV or PROD with the same chart name

Repo（仓库）= 存放内容的地方
Hub（平台）= 聚合和分发多个仓库/内容的平台

two steps to deploy the application on a kubernetes cluster:
helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com.bitnami
helm install my-release bitnami/wordpress
//verify
helm list      
helm uninstall my-release

helm repo update              //更新本地缓存的 Helm 仓库索引（index），获取最新的 Chart 列表和版本信息
因为 helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami 本地只是记录了仓库地址，并没有最新内容，所以要 helm repo update


to customise chart parameters:
$ helm pull bitnami/wordpress
$ helm pull -untar bitnami/wordpress
//verify
$ ls
wordpress
$ ls wordpress
$ helm install my-release ./wordpress


Lifecycle management with Helm:
helm install nginx-release bignami/nginx       //you can specify a version by adding: --version 7.1.0
k get pods
k describe pod <pod-name>    //get version in the image
helm upgrade nginx-release bignami/nginx
k get pods
k describe pod <pod-name>    
helm list       //get rivision 2
helm history nginx-release
helm rollback nginx-release 1    //it creates release 3 which config is the same as release 1, it's a simple example that's why there's no errors displaying when running this script, if:
helm upgrade wordpress-release bitnami/wordpress    //it shows error of password empty which would be cased by the user doesnt have admin permission

other commands:
helm repo rm hashicorp      /remove the Hashicorp helm repository from the cluster


helm list 是列的release
helm history <release-name> 是列的某个release的revisions
